# Git identity — macbuilds-dev (STRICT)

All commits to repos under **`repos/*`**, **`other repos/*`**, and **github.com/macbuilds-dev/** must use:

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| **user.name** | `macbuilds-dev` |
| **user.email** | `muhammadammarchaudhry1@gmail.com` |

Also applies to code checkouts under `~/mac/createex/`, `~/mac/freelance/`, `~/mac/personal/`, `~/mac/university/`, and `~/mac/slark/` **except** `~/mac/slark/dfc/*` (those are `webmaster-dfc`).

## Before every commit (agent MUST)

1. **Never** commit as `Ammar Chaudhry`, `mac@…local`, Cursor default, or hostname/`*.local` email.
2. Set author/committer **per commit** (do not rely on auto-detected hostname identity):

```bash
git -c user.name="macbuilds-dev" -c user.email="muhammadammarchaudhry1@gmail.com" commit -m "…"
```

3. Optional one-time **local** config per repo (not global):

```bash
git config user.name "macbuilds-dev"
git config user.email "muhammadammarchaudhry1@gmail.com"
```

4. Verify before push:

```bash
git log -1 --format='%an <%ae>'
# must show: macbuilds-dev <muhammadammarchaudhry1@gmail.com>
```

## Exception

**`webmaster-dfc/*` repos** (`~/mac/slark/dfc/dfc-*`) — see `03-git-identity-webmaster-dfc.mdc`. Do **not** use this identity there.
